  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A cool light wreathes your body for the duration, shedding Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet.</p><p>Until the spell ends, you have Resistance to Radiant damage, and your melee attacks deal an extra 2d6 Radiant damage on a hit.</p><p>In addition, immediately after you take damage from a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself, you can take a Reaction to force it to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, it has the &amp;Reference[blinded apply=false]{Blinded} condition until the end of your next turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
